WEBVTT

class_teacher-001
00:00:00.312 --> 00:00:05.778
Welcome, Class Teacher or Mu’allim, open
your school’s short link and check its own

class_teacher-002
00:00:05.778 --> 00:00:07.425
crest, motto and colours.

class_teacher-003
00:00:08.044 --> 00:00:12.697
Sign in with your registered phone number
and four-digit PIN, without email or a

class_teacher-004
00:00:12.697 --> 00:00:15.315
password, to see only your assigned
learners.

class_teacher-005
00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:21.289
Install school app gives your phone the
school crest and name, or use Safari,

class_teacher-006
00:00:21.289 --> 00:00:25.535
Share, Add to Home Screen on iPhone, then
sign in online first.

class_teacher-007
00:00:26.482 --> 00:00:31.664
Dual-role teachers switch between My Class
and My Subjects under one login, including

class_teacher-008
00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.798
assigned Halqah and subject duties.

class_teacher-009
00:00:34.838 --> 00:00:39.275
Without data or Wi-Fi, take daily
attendance in the saved app and check the

class_teacher-010
00:00:39.275 --> 00:00:42.055
local draft indicator for your class or
Halqah.

class_teacher-011
00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:47.981
Record CA and exam scores offline for your
assigned subjects, keeping drafts on this

class_teacher-012
00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:50.056
device until your connection returns.

class_teacher-013
00:00:51.352 --> 00:00:55.957
Where enabled, the Tahfeez Tracker records
daily Surah and Ayah ranges for your

class_teacher-014
00:00:55.957 --> 00:00:59.280
Halqah, with Mumtaz or Jayyid ratings and
offline drafts.

class_teacher-015
00:01:00.534 --> 00:01:04.809
Reconnect to upload and sync drafts
automatically, wait for confirmation, and

class_teacher-016
00:01:04.809 --> 00:01:07.640
review conflicts instead of overwriting
newer work.

class_teacher-017
00:01:08.905 --> 00:01:14.058
Report cards keep the same fixed A4 layout
on phone, tablet and computer, so inspect

class_teacher-018
00:01:14.058 --> 00:01:17.800
full margins and remember parents see
published results only.
